description:
## **Acceptance criteria** 

Storybook stories have been created :

* card with _**plain**_ style and 1:1 aspect ratio landscaped
* card with _**outline**_ style and 4:3 aspect ratio landscape
* card with _**haptic**_ style and 16:9 aspect ration portrait (title only)(centered)
* card with _**large**_ size and 4:3 aspect ratio portrait (centered)
* additional examples as you like 

## **Technical Details**

### molecule/Card/Card.vue

props: 

```
interface CardProps {
  title : string;
  description? : string;
  // Appearance variants
  variant: 'plain' | 'outline' | 'haptic';

  // Media
  media?: Media

  // Media Ratio
  aspectRatio?: string | number;

  // Card sizing
  size?: 'default' | 'large';

  // Content alignment
  textAlignment?: 'left' | 'center' | 'right';

  // Link configuration
  link?: {
    href: string;
    text: string;
    color: 'primary' | 'white' | 'dark';
  };

  // Call to action button
  cta?: {
    text: string;
    variant: ButtonVariant;
  };
}
```

* use `<component :is="link.href ? NuxtLink : 'div'" />` to render anchor if the whole component is linked or to render div element if not 
* for the `'outline' | 'haptic'` variant there is different paddings for the card container in mobile viewport 
* use `LuiText` `LuiButton` `LuiMedia` `LuiLink(inprogress)` components
